OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers are
OL,6,Fpossible overnight, these perhaps
OL,7,Fheavy in western coastal regions.
OL,8,FOften dry elsewhere with clear periods
OL,9,Fand turning much cooler than on
OL,10,FTuesday night, especially in the
OL,11,Fsoutheast where fog patches are
OL,12,Fpossible. Winds easing in the far
OL,13,Fnorthwest.
OL,14,
OL,15,CThursday:FAny fog soon clearing to
OL,16,Fleave a dry day for many with lengthy
OL,17,Fsunny periods. A few showers are
OL,18,Fpossible, these locally heavy in the
OL,19,Fwest. Blustery in the northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
